(405782, 35696, 10275, '<td valign="top">Oh, very beuatiful object. The sidelighting works well here. My one suggestion would be not to chop off the top bit of the bottom part of the spiral, even give it some space (if this was possible - maybe there was something above it). 9</td>', 'Oh, very beuatiful object. The sidelighting works well here. My one suggestion would be not to chop off the top bit of the bottom part of the spiral, even give it some space (if this was possible - maybe there was something above it). 9', '2003-09-01 02:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(405783, 35762, 6504, '<td valign="top">This may sound funny, but I find this picture sexy.   Excellent color, composition,<br/>lighting.  Perfect</td>', 'This may sound funny, but I find this picture sexy.   Excellent color, composition,lighting.  Perfect', '2003-09-01 02:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(405785, 35654, 6504, '<td valign="top">Good picture.   Nice and sharp, everyone can relate to this one!</td>', 'Good picture.   Nice and sharp, everyone can relate to this one!', '2003-09-01 02:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(405787, 35211, 7038, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, lighting is a little harsh on the very left card.</td>', 'I like this idea, lighting is a little harsh on the very left card.', '2003-09-01 02:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(405789, 35938, 6504, '<td valign="top">This one''s a little too dark, and it could be a very good picture otherwise.</td>', 'This one''s a little too dark, and it could be a very good picture otherwise.', '2003-09-01 02:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(405791, 35799, 10275, '<td valign="top">Powerful message in this image. Good subptle lighting from the lamp. My suggestion would be the include more of the lamp in the image for balance of the compositional triangle that the objects make together. Nicely done.</td>', 'Powerful message in this image. Good subptle lighting from the lamp. My suggestion would be the include more of the lamp in the image for balance of the compositional triangle that the objects make together. Nicely done.', '2003-09-01 02:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(405792, 35663, 6504, '<td valign="top">WOW    That''s a rare photo opportunity.  Very good capture with perfect depth of field.</td>', 'WOW    That''s a rare photo opportunity.  Very good capture with perfect depth of field.', '2003-09-01 02:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(405795, 35356, 10275, '<td valign="top">Lovely perspective shot. My only suggestion woud be to adjust your aperture (the f-stop) so the most forefront pillars would be sharper than the recieding ones. The way it is now, the front distracts a little bit from the rest of the image. Otherwise well done.</td>', 'Lovely perspective shot. My only suggestion woud be to adjust your aperture (the f-stop) so the most forefront pillars would be sharper than the recieding ones. The way it is now, the front distracts a little bit from the rest of the image. Otherwise well done.', '2003-09-01 02:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(405798, 35945, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful perspective shot. Love the afternoon light, but IMO, the shadows are little bit too busy and distract from the beauty of the columns (others may like it). Slightly different time of the day (perharps few hours earlier) would have helped with more light.</td>', 'Beautiful perspective shot. Love the afternoon light, but IMO, the shadows are little bit too busy and distract from the beauty of the columns (others may like it). Slightly different time of the day (perharps few hours earlier) would have helped with more light.', '2003-09-01 02:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(405802, 35538, 10275, '<td valign="top">The reflection here distracts a bit from the simple beauty of this shot. Perhaps different viewpoint and framing would have had more impact.</td>', 'The reflection here distracts a bit from the simple beauty of this shot. Perhaps different viewpoint and framing would have had more impact.', '2003-09-01 02:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(405803, 35356, 7038, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but focus seems a little soft</td>', 'Nice picture, but focus seems a little soft', '2003-09-01 02:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(405808, 35320, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is beauty for the eyes. Off centre composition could have had more impact. Also little bit too tightly cropped for my taste. But it''s clean and soft (no harsh hot spots), which is bonus.</td>', 'This is beauty for the eyes. Off centre composition could have had more impact. Also little bit too tightly cropped for my taste. But it''s clean and soft (no harsh hot spots), which is bonus.', '2003-09-01 02:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(405810, 34989, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting shot. Lovely colours happening here. Too bad the sky is washed out a little.</td>', 'This is very interesting shot. Lovely colours happening here. Too bad the sky is washed out a little.', '2003-09-01 02:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(405812, 35354, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful abstract. Lovely colour and soft effect. The bubble is a bonus.</td>', 'Very beautiful abstract. Lovely colour and soft effect. The bubble is a bonus.', '2003-09-01 02:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(405818, 35740, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very beatiful colourwise. The front row of the balls should have been tiny bit more in focus and then the DoF would have worked better in this case. (btw, love your camera setup).</td>', 'Very beatiful colourwise. The front row of the balls should have been tiny bit more in focus and then the DoF would have worked better in this case. (btw, love your camera setup).', '2003-09-01 02:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(405821, 35914, 10275, '<td valign="top">A bit low key photo. Could have brighten it up tiny bit. I know you were probably going for the silluette, but the ground is still too dark. But nice abstract.</td>', 'A bit low key photo. Could have brighten it up tiny bit. I know you were probably going for the silluette, but the ground is still too dark. But nice abstract.', '2003-09-01 02:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(405824, 35152, 10275, '<td valign="top">For a repetition challenge, this would have been better all in focus. But you are practicing good DoF skills and trying more artistic look. Good for you.</td>', 'For a repetition challenge, this would have been better all in focus. But you are practicing good DoF skills and trying more artistic look. Good for you.', '2003-09-01 02:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(405827, 35468, 10275, '<td valign="top">Lovely perspective shot. The red is a bit oversaturated (which is hard on the veiwer''s eyes). Also it''s a tiny bit too close cropped in the upper part of the front gate. Nevertheless, it is beatiful to look at.</td>', 'Lovely perspective shot. The red is a bit oversaturated (which is hard on the veiwer''s eyes). Also it''s a tiny bit too close cropped in the upper part of the front gate. Nevertheless, it is beatiful to look at.', '2003-09-01 02:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(405828, 35745, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is the House of Blue Hotel, Chicago, right?</td>', 'This is the House of Blue Hotel, Chicago, right?', '2003-09-01 02:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(405831, 35687, 10275, '<td valign="top">Lovely sharp, clean shot. My only suggestion is to give more breathing space around the whole setup - crop it more loosely.</td>', 'Lovely sharp, clean shot. My only suggestion is to give more breathing space around the whole setup - crop it more loosely.', '2003-09-01 02:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(405834, 35530, 10275, '<td valign="top">Tiny bit overexposed. The highlights are bleached out. Also the whole image appear to be pixelated (maybe too much compression?). Nice colour combination. Try experimenting with different setups as well for more interesting composition.</td>', 'Tiny bit overexposed. The highlights are bleached out. Also the whole image appear to be pixelated (maybe too much compression?). Nice colour combination. Try experimenting with different setups as well for more interesting composition.', '2003-09-01 02:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(405837, 35641, 10275, '<td valign="top">Too bad it''s tilted like this. I know you probably intended it this way, but it would have been interesting by itself without the tilt. Also, you could adjust the contrast of the image - the shadow areas are a bit washed out.</td>', 'Too bad it''s tilted like this. I know you probably intended it this way, but it would have been interesting by itself without the tilt. Also, you could adjust the contrast of the image - the shadow areas are a bit washed out.', '2003-09-01 02:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(405841, 35345, 10275, '<td valign="top">I hope this effect was done inside your camera, otherwise it''s quite illegal according to DPC rules. To me this doesn''t fulfull the challenge. You were sopposed to find interesting repeating subjects (not a copy of one single shot). Sorry.</td>', 'I hope this effect was done inside your camera, otherwise it''s quite illegal according to DPC rules. To me this doesn''t fulfull the challenge. You were sopposed to find interesting repeating subjects (not a copy of one single shot). Sorry.', '2003-09-01 02:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(405843, 35388, 10275, '<td valign="top">Richie, put your camera on a tripod for shots in low light. If this were in sharp focus, this would have been amazing shot.</td>', 'Richie, put your camera on a tripod for shots in low light. If this were in sharp focus, this would have been amazing shot.', '2003-09-01 02:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(405851, 35655, 2978, '<td valign="top">I really like the illusion of the curve and the natural lighting enhances it a ot too. Great job</td>', 'I really like the illusion of the curve and the natural lighting enhances it a ot too. Great job', '2003-09-01 02:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(405863, 35807, 10260, '<td valign="top">great photo.  colors, dof, exposure perfect.   And  I like horses.  Aren''t these beautiful?</td>', 'great photo.  colors, dof, exposure perfect.   And  I like horses.  Aren''t these beautiful?', '2003-09-01 03:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(405865, 35945, 10260, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  The pillars are perfect for the challenge.  I''d like to see it a little sharper, but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  The pillars are perfect for the challenge.  I''d like to see it a little sharper, but that''s just my opinion.', '2003-09-01 03:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(405867, 35357, 10260, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo.  Meets challenge theme; good colors and the border is an asset I think.</td>', 'Really nice photo.  Meets challenge theme; good colors and the border is an asset I think.', '2003-09-01 03:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
