(409123, 35780, 7304, '<td valign="top">After further review I decided to change my original vote. I think it is much better. I love the color and metallic glow. The light is a very powerful directional that leads you to the main focal point. Nice texture.</td>', 'After further review I decided to change my original vote. I think it is much better. I love the color and metallic glow. The light is a very powerful directional that leads you to the main focal point. Nice texture.', '2003-09-03 22:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
