(409127, 35018, 7304, '<td valign="top">You can get lost in the many shapes this provides.  Nice exposure and clarity. I would like to see the picture slightly off center a bit more but it is still somewhat off balance.</td>', 'You can get lost in the many shapes this provides.  Nice exposure and clarity. I would like to see the picture slightly off center a bit more but it is still somewhat off balance.', '2003-09-03 22:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
