(409200, 35852, 11073, '<td valign="top">Gordon SUCKS!!!! =`)  Jr. rules!!!!  Good, original idea.  Good lighting, colors, and dof.  BAD choice of car however ;)</td>', 'Gordon SUCKS!!!! =`)  Jr. rules!!!!  Good, original idea.  Good lighting, colors, and dof.  BAD choice of car however ;)', '2003-09-03 23:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
