(410552, 35425, 7969, '<td valign="top">Hmm, well has potential to be a ''what is it  macro'' maybe, but I would like to see maybe a bee to add a focal point of interest, just a thought.</td>', 'Hmm, well has potential to be a ''what is it  macro'' maybe, but I would like to see maybe a bee to add a focal point of interest, just a thought.', '2003-09-05 13:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(410555, 35932, 7969, '<td valign="top">Ahh the infamous slinky, at first I did not care much for your shot to be honest, though on second look I like it more. I am still wishing the light at the bottom was more subtle though.  But I like the tones and abstract feel, nice job.</td>', 'Ahh the infamous slinky, at first I did not care much for your shot to be honest, though on second look I like it more. I am still wishing the light at the bottom was more subtle though.  But I like the tones and abstract feel, nice job.', '2003-09-05 13:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(410558, 35695, 7969, '<td valign="top">I find the pavement and concrete problematic in this shot. I think it may have been a stronger image taken from the front, higlighting only the arches on top and shrubs on bottom.  Just a thought.</td>', 'I find the pavement and concrete problematic in this shot. I think it may have been a stronger image taken from the front, higlighting only the arches on top and shrubs on bottom.  Just a thought.', '2003-09-05 13:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(410559, 35487, 7969, '<td valign="top">The green light makes your shot interesting.</td>', 'The green light makes your shot interesting.', '2003-09-05 13:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(410560, 35900, 7969, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I think i feel torn, do i look at the pillars or do i look at the staris??  would  like to see shot with only one of these elements, IMO would make a stronger shot.</td>', 'Hmm, I think i feel torn, do i look at the pillars or do i look at the staris??  would  like to see shot with only one of these elements, IMO would make a stronger shot.', '2003-09-05 13:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(410562, 35407, 7969, '<td valign="top">My mentor of sorts always tells me this, ''your shot has to much going on, you need to make choices about what is really important in your shot'' and that is my advice to you.  There are too many factors here, and no real focal point.  I think the sign and the palm tree, niether of which repeat are distracting.  perhaps try re-shooting focusing only on the in between balconies and fireplaces.  just an idea. BTW your shot is sharp, well done there.</td>', 'My mentor of sorts always tells me this, ''your shot has to much going on, you need to make choices about what is really important in your shot'' and that is my advice to you.  There are too many factors here, and no real focal point.  I think the sign and the palm tree, niether of which repeat are distracting.  perhaps try re-shooting focusing only on the in between balconies and fireplaces.  just an idea. BTW your shot is sharp, well done there.', '2003-09-05 13:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(410564, 35942, 7969, '<td valign="top">If cropped slightly more off the top would make the repitition feel like it continues more than does.  Sharp first q-tip is good against the black.</td>', 'If cropped slightly more off the top would make the repitition feel like it continues more than does.  Sharp first q-tip is good against the black.', '2003-09-05 13:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(410565, 35640, 7969, '<td valign="top">This shot does have lots of repititions, but it is a very busy shot, and i think if the right would of been cropped more would highlight your ''seafood subject'' more. just a thought.</td>', 'This shot does have lots of repititions, but it is a very busy shot, and i think if the right would of been cropped more would highlight your ''seafood subject'' more. just a thought.', '2003-09-05 13:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(410566, 35457, 7969, '<td valign="top">Very hard to make these shapes out, would like to see it in b7w as more of an abstract i think, just a thought.</td>', 'Very hard to make these shapes out, would like to see it in b7w as more of an abstract i think, just a thought.', '2003-09-05 13:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(410567, 35326, 7969, '<td valign="top">I am trying to comment on all these shots, this one leaves me speechless, the thing that comes to mind is the white on right is distracting (too bright). just a thought.</td>', 'I am trying to comment on all these shots, this one leaves me speechless, the thing that comes to mind is the white on right is distracting (too bright). just a thought.', '2003-09-05 13:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(410570, 35876, 7969, '<td valign="top">Would of liked this one a bit more if the bottom left (ground?) was cropped out. The light coming in between the first and third is IMO very nice and would like this highlighted more(the crop would also do that) and take focus from the sort of blah bottom.  just my thought.</td>', 'Would of liked this one a bit more if the bottom left (ground?) was cropped out. The light coming in between the first and third is IMO very nice and would like this highlighted more(the crop would also do that) and take focus from the sort of blah bottom.  just my thought.', '2003-09-05 13:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
