(410603, 35772, 3102, '<td valign="top">Probably my favorite shot of the challenge!  I may have cropped it a little differently -- either zooming in closer on the planes in a vertical format, or moving it back just a hair so that the contrails at the top aren''t cropped out.  But this is still a great shot -- hopefully there will be a ribbon tacked to it soon! - 9</td>', 'Probably my favorite shot of the challenge!  I may have cropped it a little differently -- either zooming in closer on the planes in a vertical format, or moving it back just a hair so that the contrails at the top aren''t cropped out.  But this is still a great shot -- hopefully there will be a ribbon tacked to it soon! - 9', '2003-09-05 14:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(410611, 35762, 10263, '<td valign="top">hmmm I thought I already commented on this but evidently it didn''t stick since it says I haven''t voted on this one. I love the lines on this. The curves on the bodies accented by the straight strings is appealing. Beautiful warm tones.</td>', 'hmmm I thought I already commented on this but evidently it didn''t stick since it says I haven''t voted on this one. I love the lines on this. The curves on the bodies accented by the straight strings is appealing. Beautiful warm tones.', '2003-09-05 14:40:18.000000', NULL, 1);
