(410645, 35763, 280, '<td valign="top">I could be wrong (And lets face it I normally am) but I think you may have a winner here. Vivid colours, beautiful sky and a great scene. Just fantastic.</td>', 'I could be wrong (And lets face it I normally am) but I think you may have a winner here. Vivid colours, beautiful sky and a great scene. Just fantastic.', '2003-09-05 15:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
