(410679, 35611, 2612, '<td valign="top">Nice composition! <br/>Good attention to detail with verticles actually being verticle.<br/>I like the sense of perspective as the wall moves out to the left.<br/>The image seems a little flat, but I''m not sure why, very minor. (maybe lack of shadow)</td>', 'Nice composition! Good attention to detail with verticles actually being verticle.I like the sense of perspective as the wall moves out to the left.The image seems a little flat, but I''m not sure why, very minor. (maybe lack of shadow)', '2003-09-05 17:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(410680, 35910, 2612, '<td valign="top">Cool!<br/>I think you could have skipped the dark space on the bottom and just let the viewers eyes role over all of those dots.<br/>Still very good.</td>', 'Cool!I think you could have skipped the dark space on the bottom and just let the viewers eyes role over all of those dots.Still very good.', '2003-09-05 17:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
