(410766, 35463, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focusing makes the subject pop out of the white background. Some nice shadows and reflections gives great interest to the watch.</td>', 'Beautiful focusing makes the subject pop out of the white background. Some nice shadows and reflections gives great interest to the watch.', '2003-09-05 18:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(410768, 35763, 2170, '<td valign="top">i particularly like the Mikey balloon from Monsters Inc.  :)</td>', 'i particularly like the Mikey balloon from Monsters Inc.  :)', '2003-09-05 18:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(410771, 35660, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. You were able to capture some really nice shadows. The darkness of the shadows and the reflections of the metal really brings this piece alive. The monochrome brings out the worn look of the wheels.<br/> <br/>Nice curves and straight lines. Absolutely beautiful. Wow!</td>', 'Beautiful composition. You were able to capture some really nice shadows. The darkness of the shadows and the reflections of the metal really brings this piece alive. The monochrome brings out the worn look of the wheels. Nice curves and straight lines. Absolutely beautiful. Wow!', '2003-09-05 18:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(410773, 35763, 10084, '<td valign="top">Would make a good postcard. Great composition. Beautiful colors. Good depth of field. Nice shadows in the folds of the balloons.</td>', 'Would make a good postcard. Great composition. Beautiful colors. Good depth of field. Nice shadows in the folds of the balloons.', '2003-09-05 19:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(410775, 35808, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great focusing job. You were able to capture some really nice reflections and shadows. It really makes the subject pop out of the shot.  Composition is really interesting.</td>', 'Great focusing job. You were able to capture some really nice reflections and shadows. It really makes the subject pop out of the shot.  Composition is really interesting.', '2003-09-05 19:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(410791, 35914, 2170, '<td valign="top">gorgeous shot!</td>', 'gorgeous shot!', '2003-09-05 19:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(410804, 35741, 10698, '<td valign="top">Although this makes me dizzy, it''s a great, crisp shot!  I love the perspective.</td>', 'Although this makes me dizzy, it''s a great, crisp shot!  I love the perspective.', '2003-09-05 19:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(410806, 35875, 10698, '<td valign="top">I like the depth of field and how you caught the three birds looking in completely different directions.  I think I would have liked this either brightened a little more, or turned to grayscale.</td>', 'I like the depth of field and how you caught the three birds looking in completely different directions.  I think I would have liked this either brightened a little more, or turned to grayscale.', '2003-09-05 19:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(410808, 35457, 1041, '<td valign="top">Definitely repetition.  Is this some sort of outside sculpture?  Pretty cool.  Was there a possibility of getting this from an angle where the buildings weren''t intruding in the background?  The parts that are contrasted against the blue sky look much better to me, the ones against the building are a little difficult to pick ou.</td>', 'Definitely repetition.  Is this some sort of outside sculpture?  Pretty cool.  Was there a possibility of getting this from an angle where the buildings weren''t intruding in the background?  The parts that are contrasted against the blue sky look much better to me, the ones against the building are a little difficult to pick ou.', '2003-09-05 19:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(410815, 35660, 10698, '<td valign="top">Really like this photo, and I would haved scored it way higher, but I don''t quite see it strongly representing repetition.</td>', 'Really like this photo, and I would haved scored it way higher, but I don''t quite see it strongly representing repetition.', '2003-09-05 20:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(410817, 35655, 10698, '<td valign="top">Cool!  Nice catch with the sunlight!  Meets the theme, but could have possibly used a little more sharpening.</td>', 'Cool!  Nice catch with the sunlight!  Meets the theme, but could have possibly used a little more sharpening.', '2003-09-05 20:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(410818, 35530, 1041, '<td valign="top">Definitely repetition here.  I like the format and the fact that you almost paired the different beads up.  I think the two areas that let you down are the frame (althugh others might say the opposite, it''s very much personal taste) and the lighting.  You are obviously trying for high-key and an even background ... depending on your camera, try using the EV balance, you''ll be amazed just how much you have to overexpose compared to your camera''s default metering, plus it''ll look better because the edges of objects will be better defined.  As usual, this is of course just my personal opinion :)</td>', 'Definitely repetition here.  I like the format and the fact that you almost paired the different beads up.  I think the two areas that let you down are the frame (althugh others might say the opposite, it''s very much personal taste) and the lighting.  You are obviously trying for high-key and an even background ... depending on your camera, try using the EV balance, you''ll be amazed just how much you have to overexpose compared to your camera''s default metering, plus it''ll look better because the edges of objects will be better defined.  As usual, this is of course just my personal opinion :)', '2003-09-05 20:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(410820, 35943, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hi Mike.  I always enjoy pix of your daughter, she''s just such a cutie, even when she''s pouting like this.  Great capture, especially with the catchlights in her eyes.  The only criticism I have is that - w/out the title - I wouldn''t get why this is repetition.  Maybe you have to have kids of your own to get this w/out the title, who knows ...</td>', 'Hi Mike.  I always enjoy pix of your daughter, she''s just such a cutie, even when she''s pouting like this.  Great capture, especially with the catchlights in her eyes.  The only criticism I have is that - w/out the title - I wouldn''t get why this is repetition.  Maybe you have to have kids of your own to get this w/out the title, who knows ...', '2003-09-05 20:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(410822, 35911, 10698, '<td valign="top">I try to forget my bias for "beach photos" when I vote, but I think this is a great photo!  Perfect framing, and I love the great diagonal shadowing and the action of the water at the end.  May have tried to brighten this a bit, and saturated a touch, but overall I really like it.  Congratulations!</td>', 'I try to forget my bias for "beach photos" when I vote, but I think this is a great photo!  Perfect framing, and I love the great diagonal shadowing and the action of the water at the end.  May have tried to brighten this a bit, and saturated a touch, but overall I really like it.  Congratulations!', '2003-09-05 20:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(410823, 35784, 1041, '<td valign="top">Without a doubt my abosolute favorite for this challenge, you are bound to get one of the ribbons :)  The idea, composition, and technical execution are absolutely flawless and you meet the challenge.  If I look around the pic long enough I might notice that the first angel is just a little bit more exposed than the others, but I''m really nitpicking there.  The crop is just a little bit tight at the bottom for me but regardless, your lighting is fantastic and they really do seem to be floating!  Wow.  :)</td>', 'Without a doubt my abosolute favorite for this challenge, you are bound to get one of the ribbons :)  The idea, composition, and technical execution are absolutely flawless and you meet the challenge.  If I look around the pic long enough I might notice that the first angel is just a little bit more exposed than the others, but I''m really nitpicking there.  The crop is just a little bit tight at the bottom for me but regardless, your lighting is fantastic and they really do seem to be floating!  Wow.  :)', '2003-09-05 20:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(410826, 35740, 10698, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge theme, but I would have liked a little more DOF to keep these all in focus.  Cool lighting effect though!</td>', 'Meets the challenge theme, but I would have liked a little more DOF to keep these all in focus.  Cool lighting effect though!', '2003-09-05 20:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(410829, 35722, 1041, '<td valign="top">A contribution from one of our many icelandic friends :)  You kind of meet the challenge (if I know the theme and look hard for it), but it''s in my opinion not a strong-point of the image, what comes to mind more is a reflection and silhouette theme.  Technically good exposure and I bet you get some comments about the people in the bottom right, I actually like them.  Outside of the challenge I would clone out the orange dot (from the bank logo?) because it draws the eye away from the silhouette, but of course you can''t do this for the challenge ...</td>', 'A contribution from one of our many icelandic friends :)  You kind of meet the challenge (if I know the theme and look hard for it), but it''s in my opinion not a strong-point of the image, what comes to mind more is a reflection and silhouette theme.  Technically good exposure and I bet you get some comments about the people in the bottom right, I actually like them.  Outside of the challenge I would clone out the orange dot (from the bank logo?) because it draws the eye away from the silhouette, but of course you can''t do this for the challenge ...', '2003-09-05 20:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(410830, 35687, 10698, '<td valign="top">Makes my mouth water!  Nice concept, but would have liked the top cropped down more, even if the top right leaf was sacrificed a little.  These look good "smushed" together and a top crop would have enhanced that.</td>', 'Makes my mouth water!  Nice concept, but would have liked the top cropped down more, even if the top right leaf was sacrificed a little.  These look good "smushed" together and a top crop would have enhanced that.', '2003-09-05 20:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(410832, 35418, 1041, '<td valign="top">Another icelandic contribution I think :)  Without the challenge topic, repetition wouldn''t have been the first thing to come to mind, although I can see with the title and everything what you mean.  The pic is a little smaller than I''d like to see but the focus and use of DOF is fantastic,  I also like the border :)  Maybe use a plainer background in the bottom left corner (or just go with b&amp;w to deemphasize it) and I think you''ve done a bit too much contrast adjustment, the corners at the top are blown out.</td>', 'Another icelandic contribution I think :)  Without the challenge topic, repetition wouldn''t have been the first thing to come to mind, although I can see with the title and everything what you mean.  The pic is a little smaller than I''d like to see but the focus and use of DOF is fantastic,  I also like the border :)  Maybe use a plainer background in the bottom left corner (or just go with b&w to deemphasize it) and I think you''ve done a bit too much contrast adjustment, the corners at the top are blown out.', '2003-09-05 20:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(410834, 35946, 1041, '<td valign="top">Repetition, absolutely.  A subject that holds very much interest it is not, at least not to me, sorry.  B&amp;w works, am curious though what color they actually are.  Possibly just simply white?  Nice arrangement and composition with the diagonal, and the light and shadow adds to the photo, too.</td>', 'Repetition, absolutely.  A subject that holds very much interest it is not, at least not to me, sorry.  B&w works, am curious though what color they actually are.  Possibly just simply white?  Nice arrangement and composition with the diagonal, and the light and shadow adds to the photo, too.', '2003-09-05 20:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(410851, 35763, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Definitely repetition and definitely a stunning shot.  Absolutely wonderful capture and the blue sky and puffy clouds really hellp.  Oh, ok, so I''m jealous because when I went to a hotair balloon festival it was gray and drab all day.  One of my top favorites here, anyhow.</td>', 'Wow.  Definitely repetition and definitely a stunning shot.  Absolutely wonderful capture and the blue sky and puffy clouds really hellp.  Oh, ok, so I''m jealous because when I went to a hotair balloon festival it was gray and drab all day.  One of my top favorites here, anyhow.', '2003-09-05 21:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(410852, 35388, 1041, '<td valign="top">Yep, repetition, but unfortunately, while the idea is really good, the execution leaves some to be desired.  It''s very blurry (some motion blur) and misses focus.  Plus, the light on the arm is too bright. I do like that the Richie''s seem to go on forever :)</td>', 'Yep, repetition, but unfortunately, while the idea is really good, the execution leaves some to be desired.  It''s very blurry (some motion blur) and misses focus.  Plus, the light on the arm is too bright. I do like that the Richie''s seem to go on forever :)', '2003-09-05 21:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(410853, 35918, 1041, '<td valign="top">Interesting with the black background and the TV barely visible in the corner.  Would''ve been a really good entry for the negative space challenge.  Gotta admit that - w/out the title - this does not say repetition to me.  Love the great range of tonality and b&amp;w was definitely the right choice.</td>', 'Interesting with the black background and the TV barely visible in the corner.  Would''ve been a really good entry for the negative space challenge.  Gotta admit that - w/out the title - this does not say repetition to me.  Love the great range of tonality and b&w was definitely the right choice.', '2003-09-05 21:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(410894, 35369, 10218, '<td valign="top">I love the angle, the pattern in the grate, the textures, etc...  Excellent shot.</td>', 'I love the angle, the pattern in the grate, the textures, etc...  Excellent shot.', '2003-09-05 23:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(410895, 35943, 10218, '<td valign="top">Haha.  A good take on ''repetition.''  Unfortunately, I don''t see it doing well.  I would give you comedic value.</td>', 'Haha.  A good take on ''repetition.''  Unfortunately, I don''t see it doing well.  I would give you comedic value.', '2003-09-05 23:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(410897, 35356, 10218, '<td valign="top">The arches and columns are very neat looking.  Would''ve liked it more without the trash cans and such on the side.  Needs to be in focus better.</td>', 'The arches and columns are very neat looking.  Would''ve liked it more without the trash cans and such on the side.  Needs to be in focus better.', '2003-09-05 23:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(410900, 35859, 10218, '<td valign="top">I think it would''ve looked better had the focus been closer to the center of the shot.</td>', 'I think it would''ve looked better had the focus been closer to the center of the shot.', '2003-09-05 23:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(410903, 35018, 10218, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Very cool looking.  I''d like to see what it looks like from the side.  I think it would''ve been strong if it were squared up a bit; needs to be rotated clockwise.</td>', 'Wow.  Very cool looking.  I''d like to see what it looks like from the side.  I think it would''ve been strong if it were squared up a bit; needs to be rotated clockwise.', '2003-09-05 23:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(410904, 35762, 10218, '<td valign="top">The last guitar needs to be more visible.</td>', 'The last guitar needs to be more visible.', '2003-09-05 23:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(410905, 35784, 10218, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  The figures are full of clear detail, and the colors are bright and vivid.  Good job, you just might get a glimpse of heaven. ;)</td>', 'Excellent composition.  The figures are full of clear detail, and the colors are bright and vivid.  Good job, you just might get a glimpse of heaven. ;)', '2003-09-05 23:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(410906, 35926, 7969, '<td valign="top">Shot is certainly clear and sharp.</td>', 'Shot is certainly clear and sharp.', '2003-09-05 23:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(410911, 35784, 6661, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot, great idea, flawless execution</td>', 'A beautiful shot, great idea, flawless execution', '2003-09-05 23:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(410927, 35695, 1041, '<td valign="top">Definitely fulfills the challenge.  Not the most attention-grabbing picture otherwise, though.  I do like the perspective and all the different lines running through the image, not too thrilled by all the leaves on the pavement but it''s not like you are going to sweep those up for a photo ...</td>', 'Definitely fulfills the challenge.  Not the most attention-grabbing picture otherwise, though.  I do like the perspective and all the different lines running through the image, not too thrilled by all the leaves on the pavement but it''s not like you are going to sweep those up for a photo ...', '2003-09-06 00:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(410930, 35947, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great subject for this challenge.  I like that the "bikes" are lined up pretty exactly and the colors.  The somewhat OOF or fuzzy look of the image lets you down though.  Not sure whether it''s compression but I don''t think so because the sky looks nice.</td>', 'Great subject for this challenge.  I like that the "bikes" are lined up pretty exactly and the colors.  The somewhat OOF or fuzzy look of the image lets you down though.  Not sure whether it''s compression but I don''t think so because the sky looks nice.', '2003-09-06 00:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(410934, 35213, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge, lots of different repetitions going on.  Unfortunately, I feel you are being let down by the technical aspect of your image.  The lighting is nice and even (no shadows), the colors are quite good, but overall, there''s no specific point that''s really sharp, crisp and in focus.  Don''t know if it''s beyond the limitations of the camera (are you too close) or somehow due to OOF and post-processing.</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge, lots of different repetitions going on.  Unfortunately, I feel you are being let down by the technical aspect of your image.  The lighting is nice and even (no shadows), the colors are quite good, but overall, there''s no specific point that''s really sharp, crisp and in focus.  Don''t know if it''s beyond the limitations of the camera (are you too close) or somehow due to OOF and post-processing.', '2003-09-06 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(410937, 35797, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very cool, and meets the challenge.  I love how the heads are all turned a little differently, and the strong directional lighting and resulting shadows add interest.  Nice tonal range, b&amp;w is a good choice.  I''d like to see a little less black space at the top and maybe just a little more at the bottom (assuming there''s nothing in the way).  Gotta see it to be sure though.</td>', 'Very cool, and meets the challenge.  I love how the heads are all turned a little differently, and the strong directional lighting and resulting shadows add interest.  Nice tonal range, b&w is a good choice.  I''d like to see a little less black space at the top and maybe just a little more at the bottom (assuming there''s nothing in the way).  Gotta see it to be sure though.', '2003-09-06 00:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(410945, 35892, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Definitely repetition.  Caught at the right moment.  I wish the focus wa on the first lady, not the second one.  Plus, the bright yellow light on the right draws the eye away from the actual subject a bit.  Would you have been able to change your location to be further right?  Less direct light and the ladies wouldn''t be quite so overlayed.  But I understand that chances are that you weren''t able to do that because of stuff outside the pic that we dont'' see.</td>', 'Very cool.  Definitely repetition.  Caught at the right moment.  I wish the focus wa on the first lady, not the second one.  Plus, the bright yellow light on the right draws the eye away from the actual subject a bit.  Would you have been able to change your location to be further right?  Less direct light and the ladies wouldn''t be quite so overlayed.  But I understand that chances are that you weren''t able to do that because of stuff outside the pic that we dont'' see.', '2003-09-06 00:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(410948, 35463, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very nice watch / stock photo.  You controlled the reflective surfaces extremely well.  Nice focus, and centering the watch works here.  I personally find the big black border too overbearing, maybe just a gray one?  Most of all, w/out the title, I don''t think repetition would''ve come to mind for me.  In a stock photo challenge, this would''ve been one of my high scores.</td>', 'Very nice watch / stock photo.  You controlled the reflective surfaces extremely well.  Nice focus, and centering the watch works here.  I personally find the big black border too overbearing, maybe just a gray one?  Most of all, w/out the title, I don''t think repetition would''ve come to mind for me.  In a stock photo challenge, this would''ve been one of my high scores.', '2003-09-06 00:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(410951, 35866, 1041, '<td valign="top">Definitely repetition.  They are on a mirror, right?  I am puzzled as to why you included your hand and the camera, they detract from the image for me.  That''s totally subjective of course.  Overall, I think the image is too grainy and a bit dark, some of that could be taken care of in post-processing.</td>', 'Definitely repetition.  They are on a mirror, right?  I am puzzled as to why you included your hand and the camera, they detract from the image for me.  That''s totally subjective of course.  Overall, I think the image is too grainy and a bit dark, some of that could be taken care of in post-processing.', '2003-09-06 00:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(410954, 34997, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You have two totally different types of repetition going (the tail feathers in the traditional sense plus the beating wings) plus you have a wonderful photos of a hummingbird, which I know are extremely difficult to photograph.  Awesome.  A little more room to the right would be perfect (but even just getting the whole bird in the photo is an achievement, so I''m just nitpicking)  Great job, even down to the catchlight in the eye.</td>', 'Wow.  You have two totally different types of repetition going (the tail feathers in the traditional sense plus the beating wings) plus you have a wonderful photos of a hummingbird, which I know are extremely difficult to photograph.  Awesome.  A little more room to the right would be perfect (but even just getting the whole bird in the photo is an achievement, so I''m just nitpicking)  Great job, even down to the catchlight in the eye.', '2003-09-06 00:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(410961, 35523, 326, '<td valign="top">Good shot!</td>', 'Good shot!', '2003-09-06 01:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
