(411061, 35763, 3032, '<td valign="top">Owwwwwwwwww, a dream subject. Balloons are so cool, all the different colors, patterns in the sky, strange funny shapes. Another interesting subject when it comes to this is kite-surfing. Especially when large groups of them crowd a small bit of the lake or sea.<br/> <br/>Nice shot. I like it how the scene seems to grow from small to big. Fluffy clouds make for a good sky. Great colors.</td>', 'Owwwwwwwwww, a dream subject. Balloons are so cool, all the different colors, patterns in the sky, strange funny shapes. Another interesting subject when it comes to this is kite-surfing. Especially when large groups of them crowd a small bit of the lake or sea. Nice shot. I like it how the scene seems to grow from small to big. Fluffy clouds make for a good sky. Great colors.', '2003-09-06 09:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(411062, 35761, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great idea, chosen color combinations works very well.</td>', 'Great idea, chosen color combinations works very well.', '2003-09-06 09:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(411067, 35927, 3540, '<td valign="top">DOF on this photo might be a little too shallow.  Going out of focus is great.  I think that would really work if there were 20.  With 5, the first couple probably should be in focus.</td>', 'DOF on this photo might be a little too shallow.  Going out of focus is great.  I think that would really work if there were 20.  With 5, the first couple probably should be in focus.', '2003-09-06 09:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(411091, 35947, 3540, '<td valign="top">This photo lacks clarity.  Either everything is slightly out of focus, or after resizing you need to sharpen it one time to restore the clarity.</td>', 'This photo lacks clarity.  Either everything is slightly out of focus, or after resizing you need to sharpen it one time to restore the clarity.', '2003-09-06 12:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(411135, 35640, 8637, '<td valign="top">Seems a little soft, and right side of image detracts from the main concept.  Neat idea though.</td>', 'Seems a little soft, and right side of image detracts from the main concept.  Neat idea though.', '2003-09-06 15:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
