(411282, 35661, 10402, '<td valign="top">So what appears to be repetition isn''t really. And what should be vertical you''ve put diagonally. It works for me; I think this is a great photo. Creative composition and technically well done.</td>', 'So what appears to be repetition isn''t really. And what should be vertical you''ve put diagonally. It works for me; I think this is a great photo. Creative composition and technically well done.', '2003-09-06 23:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
