(411291, 35715, 3540, '<td valign="top">THey look like bridge girder diaphragms to me.  Pretty well done.  I really am not sure why black and white though.</td>', 'THey look like bridge girder diaphragms to me.  Pretty well done.  I really am not sure why black and white though.', '2003-09-06 23:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(411292, 35532, 11899, '<td valign="top">I like this one..wish your colors were a little sharper though.</td>', 'I like this one..wish your colors were a little sharper though.', '2003-09-06 23:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(411293, 35745, 1379, '<td valign="top">Love it!  I get a really interesting effect when I scroll up and down on this photo.  The rhythm is so interesting, and I love that slice of sky between the two.  Awesome.</td>', 'Love it!  I get a really interesting effect when I scroll up and down on this photo.  The rhythm is so interesting, and I love that slice of sky between the two.  Awesome.', '2003-09-06 23:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(411294, 35611, 11899, '<td valign="top">Nice photo</td>', 'Nice photo', '2003-09-06 23:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(411295, 35611, 6325, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this image. I think it would benefit from some post processing - if the water were darker,  the marble tiles more saturated, and everthing more punchy with global contrast with USM, it would be great. Still an 8 for me.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this image. I think it would benefit from some post processing - if the water were darker,  the marble tiles more saturated, and everthing more punchy with global contrast with USM, it would be great. Still an 8 for me.', '2003-09-06 23:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(411296, 35780, 6325, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of light. My eyes just wander around happily finding new patterns.</td>', 'Wonderful use of light. My eyes just wander around happily finding new patterns.', '2003-09-06 23:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(411297, 35653, 7778, '<td valign="top">The crop, so critical for this minimal shot, is quite good. <br/> <br/>I have toyed with the possibility to shift that crop (the entire final image) slightly to the left, mainly to slow the flow (eye movement), but remain unsure about a measurerable improvement on what is there.<br/> <br/>The emphasis on texture is quite strong, considering that form is the dominant subject (?). The juxtaposition of the single-ringed columns (?) with the angular repeat of light and shadow makes for a satisfying contrast of opposites, while remaining true to a theme. <br/> <br/>The slight flaw (top left, edge of centre and left column) is a little distracting, given the perfectionist manner and minimal subject. I see, however, no way of avoiding this within the contest rules.<br/> <br/>One of the best entries, IMO, by one with a breath for detail and composition.</td>', 'The crop, so critical for this minimal shot, is quite good.  I have toyed with the possibility to shift that crop (the entire final image) slightly to the left, mainly to slow the flow (eye movement), but remain unsure about a measurerable improvement on what is there. The emphasis on texture is quite strong, considering that form is the dominant subject (?). The juxtaposition of the single-ringed columns (?) with the angular repeat of light and shadow makes for a satisfying contrast of opposites, while remaining true to a theme.  The slight flaw (top left, edge of centre and left column) is a little distracting, given the perfectionist manner and minimal subject. I see, however, no way of avoiding this within the contest rules. One of the best entries, IMO, by one with a breath for detail and composition.', '2003-09-06 23:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(411299, 35910, 6325, '<td valign="top">This twists my brain (in a good way).</td>', 'This twists my brain (in a good way).', '2003-09-06 23:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(411303, 35653, 6325, '<td valign="top">The lighting shows off the shape very well. Nicely done.</td>', 'The lighting shows off the shape very well. Nicely done.', '2003-09-06 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
