(411530, 35551, 3607, '<td valign="top">interesting subject and nicely capured.  some ideas you might want to try include not using a symmetrical (straight on) approach, and boosting the saturation a bit to bring out the colors more.  good job of makeing the background seem not to be there.</td>', 'interesting subject and nicely capured.  some ideas you might want to try include not using a symmetrical (straight on) approach, and boosting the saturation a bit to bring out the colors more.  good job of makeing the background seem not to be there.', '2003-09-07 15:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
