(411533, 35536, 11184, '<td valign="top">The ''ol  B&amp;W train tracks shot.  A timeless classic. Well, this might as well be the one we refer to when we refer to the ''ol B&amp;W train tracks shot, because can''t be done much better.  Makes me want to quit my job and get the band back together....and I don''t even have a band OR a job.  Great shot!</td>', 'The ''ol  B&W train tracks shot.  A timeless classic. Well, this might as well be the one we refer to when we refer to the ''ol B&W train tracks shot, because can''t be done much better.  Makes me want to quit my job and get the band back together....and I don''t even have a band OR a job.  Great shot!', '2003-09-07 15:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
