(411537, 35866, 3607, '<td valign="top">i like the idea of using a mirror, but i really don''t like the hand and camera in the photo - i just don''t see what it adds to the photo or the theme.  a little boost in the saturation would have brought out the colors a little more.</td>', 'i like the idea of using a mirror, but i really don''t like the hand and camera in the photo - i just don''t see what it adds to the photo or the theme.  a little boost in the saturation would have brought out the colors a little more.', '2003-09-07 16:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
