(411549, 35509, 11184, '<td valign="top">WOW...great job.  Only photo concern would possibly be the blurry "I" up front... borderline distracting for the eye (no pun intended).  Beautiful handwriting though (pen and paper too).  Amazingly neat, uniform, and "repeatably" accurate.  I''d need a printer and a fancy font to even think of doing a shot like this myself.  I''m wondering though if the writing is almost too professional for this?  Love it visually, but really changes the context from the classic ''school/teacher'' feel.  Wondering if you meant to do that, and if there is some other statement being made by using obvious adult/professional handwriting in pen.</td>', 'WOW...great job.  Only photo concern would possibly be the blurry "I" up front... borderline distracting for the eye (no pun intended).  Beautiful handwriting though (pen and paper too).  Amazingly neat, uniform, and "repeatably" accurate.  I''d need a printer and a fancy font to even think of doing a shot like this myself.  I''m wondering though if the writing is almost too professional for this?  Love it visually, but really changes the context from the classic ''school/teacher'' feel.  Wondering if you meant to do that, and if there is some other statement being made by using obvious adult/professional handwriting in pen.', '2003-09-07 16:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(411552, 35926, 3607, '<td valign="top">you definately captured repetition, monotony.  i like the empty space on the right.  i wonder if it would have worked better in b&amp;w but probably not.</td>', 'you definately captured repetition, monotony.  i like the empty space on the right.  i wonder if it would have worked better in b&w but probably not.', '2003-09-07 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
