(411586, 35784, 11184, '<td valign="top">WOW!  BLUE!, BLUE!!  Exxxxxcellent idea, perfectly executed!  I am amazed.  This is the BEST shot for this site in history and should be added to the homepage forever! Absolute iconic brilliance!!   Genius!  10++++++  Anyone who votes under 9 for this is a fool with an attitude problem.</td>', 'WOW!  BLUE!, BLUE!!  Exxxxxcellent idea, perfectly executed!  I am amazed.  This is the BEST shot for this site in history and should be added to the homepage forever! Absolute iconic brilliance!!   Genius!  10++++++  Anyone who votes under 9 for this is a fool with an attitude problem.', '2003-09-07 16:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
