(411592, 35211, 11184, '<td valign="top">Cheater.  No wonder why I always lose at cards.  Very well done.  Perfectly fanned out cards...allllllmost (the last 9 to the left is showing the big inside heart..lighting getting a little harsh there too).  Great shot thoguh.  BUT MY BIG QUESTION IS:<br/> <br/>why 9''s?   (noticed there are 9 X 2 cards too)</td>', 'Cheater.  No wonder why I always lose at cards.  Very well done.  Perfectly fanned out cards...allllllmost (the last 9 to the left is showing the big inside heart..lighting getting a little harsh there too).  Great shot thoguh.  BUT MY BIG QUESTION IS: why 9''s?   (noticed there are 9 X 2 cards too)', '2003-09-07 17:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(411593, 35899, 6597, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo good composition 6</td>', 'Very interesting photo good composition 6', '2003-09-07 17:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(411597, 35889, 7778, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but love this superbly solemn and dignified image. The inclusive perspective is suggestive of the composition, making apt and sensitive use of the natural lay of the land. I feel, however, that the horizontal space availble above stones could more than what it is to balance the flat plain and the slope beneath them.<br/> <br/>I''d also wish for a crisper focus, even an outright soft one, at that. I suspect that the shot may have been taken hand-held, without tripod and subsequently sharpened (?).<br/> <br/>Nevertheless, this photo contains so much more than what the topic asked for. It documents part of the human condition and places (or finds) in a landscape that could be called anywhere.<br/> <br/>The irregular, yet care-ful placement of the stones encourages a count.</td>', 'I can''t help but love this superbly solemn and dignified image. The inclusive perspective is suggestive of the composition, making apt and sensitive use of the natural lay of the land. I feel, however, that the horizontal space availble above stones could more than what it is to balance the flat plain and the slope beneath them. I''d also wish for a crisper focus, even an outright soft one, at that. I suspect that the shot may have been taken hand-held, without tripod and subsequently sharpened (?). Nevertheless, this photo contains so much more than what the topic asked for. It documents part of the human condition and places (or finds) in a landscape that could be called anywhere. The irregular, yet care-ful placement of the stones encourages a count.', '2003-09-07 17:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(411602, 35794, 11184, '<td valign="top">Is that for real or were they just posing for you?</td>', 'Is that for real or were they just posing for you?', '2003-09-07 17:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(411619, 35507, 7778, '<td valign="top">The seemingly random placement of the roled bales on the ground and the cloudy, but not all dark sky provide exactly what is needed to render such a serene and pastoral lay.<br/> <br/>The image is a little dark, perhaps, more suitable for an etching, IMO, than for the purpose here, particularly with respect to the highlights on the bales. With the horizon almost centred, a static quality has been introduced, for which I can find no purpose. The soft focus chosen here, I feel, is a debatable, but probably a deliberate choice based on a personal aesthetic.<br/> <br/>All in all, a beautiful photo approaching the  c l a s s i c.</td>', 'The seemingly random placement of the roled bales on the ground and the cloudy, but not all dark sky provide exactly what is needed to render such a serene and pastoral lay. The image is a little dark, perhaps, more suitable for an etching, IMO, than for the purpose here, particularly with respect to the highlights on the bales. With the horizon almost centred, a static quality has been introduced, for which I can find no purpose. The soft focus chosen here, I feel, is a debatable, but probably a deliberate choice based on a personal aesthetic. All in all, a beautiful photo approaching the  c l a s s i c.', '2003-09-07 18:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(411632, 35722, 8610, '<td valign="top">Þú hýri Hafnarfjörður.. vel gert, hefði þó sleppt persónunni</td>', 'Þú hýri Hafnarfjörður.. vel gert, hefði þó sleppt persónunni', '2003-09-07 18:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(411640, 35911, 7778, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing and strong perspective shot with wave and white-caps breaking up the static of the dominant structure. The two (flanking) effective arches in the foreground provide a nice counter balance to the rectangular theme.<br/> <br/>I question the DOF chosen for this shot. While it works well to bring out the textures of the foremost columns, I regret not being able to enjoy the breakers in their full and crisp glory. A larger or more deliberately choice, IMO, could highlight the spray or help distinguish the sky from the horizon. <br/> <br/>Despite this, it remains one of my favourite shots in this challenge.</td>', 'Very pleasing and strong perspective shot with wave and white-caps breaking up the static of the dominant structure. The two (flanking) effective arches in the foreground provide a nice counter balance to the rectangular theme. I question the DOF chosen for this shot. While it works well to bring out the textures of the foremost columns, I regret not being able to enjoy the breakers in their full and crisp glory. A larger or more deliberately choice, IMO, could highlight the spray or help distinguish the sky from the horizon.  Despite this, it remains one of my favourite shots in this challenge.', '2003-09-07 19:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(411642, 35763, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good colors.  I like the varying depths of the balloons in the sky.  Nice work.</td>', 'Good colors.  I like the varying depths of the balloons in the sky.  Nice work.', '2003-09-07 19:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(411643, 35653, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good study of texture, lighting, shadows and geometry.  Not super interesting, but a very solid, sound photo.</td>', 'Good study of texture, lighting, shadows and geometry.  Not super interesting, but a very solid, sound photo.', '2003-09-07 19:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(411645, 35538, 3540, '<td valign="top">Hm.... I think we have one of these.  Partylight?  The little overexposure of the flames is good.  The photo for this challenge is not really fitting IMO.</td>', 'Hm.... I think we have one of these.  Partylight?  The little overexposure of the flames is good.  The photo for this challenge is not really fitting IMO.', '2003-09-07 19:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
