(411648, 35775, 8522, '<td valign="top">I really dislike this border. Subject is interesting, but the composition needs more to sustain interest. Not sure about the lighting and glare. Nice turquoise colour though. 4</td>', 'I really dislike this border. Subject is interesting, but the composition needs more to sustain interest. Not sure about the lighting and glare. Nice turquoise colour though. 4', '2003-09-07 19:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
