(411653, 35885, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition is a bit messy here, it may have worked if there was sky behind the rows of houses. Not sure about the light here. Attention to detail; it''s always worth checking the spelling of your title! 5</td>', 'Composition is a bit messy here, it may have worked if there was sky behind the rows of houses. Not sure about the light here. Attention to detail; it''s always worth checking the spelling of your title! 5', '2003-09-07 19:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
