(411657, 35316, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice duotone, lovely range of tones. Great sky. Composition doesn''t work for me though, maybe ''rule of thirds'' could have helped you here. The composition also seems a bit flat without an extra element to add interest. 6</td>', 'Nice duotone, lovely range of tones. Great sky. Composition doesn''t work for me though, maybe ''rule of thirds'' could have helped you here. The composition also seems a bit flat without an extra element to add interest. 6', '2003-09-07 19:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(411660, 35326, 8522, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea, I presume this was done with mirrors. 10 out of 10 for creativity. However, you have badly blown out highlights and a very unappealing colour cast. Nothing is very sharp. Depth of field is too shallow. The title is spelt wrong (it''s all part of the package!). I''d love to see this shot again when you''ve developed your technique. 6</td>', 'Fantastic idea, I presume this was done with mirrors. 10 out of 10 for creativity. However, you have badly blown out highlights and a very unappealing colour cast. Nothing is very sharp. Depth of field is too shallow. The title is spelt wrong (it''s all part of the package!). I''d love to see this shot again when you''ve developed your technique. 6', '2003-09-07 19:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(411661, 35507, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, I like the range of tones here. However, the horizon is unimaginatively placed in the middle of the picture which doesn''t work well too often, and I think that there needs to be something more in the foreground to sustain interest. 6</td>', 'Nice sky, I like the range of tones here. However, the horizon is unimaginatively placed in the middle of the picture which doesn''t work well too often, and I think that there needs to be something more in the foreground to sustain interest. 6', '2003-09-07 19:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(411664, 35797, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea, shame the shadows are so deep in the eye sockets though. Great composition. Works well in b&amp;w. 7</td>', 'Great idea, shame the shadows are so deep in the eye sockets though. Great composition. Works well in b&w. 7', '2003-09-07 19:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(411665, 35152, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition needs more to hold my interest. Not really sure what the shot is trying to achieve. 5</td>', 'Composition needs more to hold my interest. Not really sure what the shot is trying to achieve. 5', '2003-09-07 19:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(411666, 35757, 8522, '<td valign="top">I have nothing against abstracts, but I can''t see what this one is trying to achieve. 4</td>', 'I have nothing against abstracts, but I can''t see what this one is trying to achieve. 4', '2003-09-07 19:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(411667, 35927, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea, nicely executed. I''d be interested to know your setup. Not quite sure about your lighting though, bit too much glare on the foregound button for my liking. 7</td>', 'Lovely idea, nicely executed. I''d be interested to know your setup. Not quite sure about your lighting though, bit too much glare on the foregound button for my liking. 7', '2003-09-07 19:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(411668, 35784, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Nicely set up, the flowers look great. Very effective background, your lighting is great, those angels don''t look easy to light well. Angels aren''t entirely to my taste though, so score: 8</td>', 'Great idea! Nicely set up, the flowers look great. Very effective background, your lighting is great, those angels don''t look easy to light well. Angels aren''t entirely to my taste though, so score: 8', '2003-09-07 19:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(411669, 35349, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect, great light and textures. I''d be interested to know if Gaussian Blur was applied here. Great dof, very artistic. The composition doesn''t quite work for me though, the 2 main places where your eye wants to rest are not comfortable... especially right at the top of the frame. 8</td>', 'Very nice effect, great light and textures. I''d be interested to know if Gaussian Blur was applied here. Great dof, very artistic. The composition doesn''t quite work for me though, the 2 main places where your eye wants to rest are not comfortable... especially right at the top of the frame. 8', '2003-09-07 19:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(411670, 35369, 8522, '<td valign="top">Too symmetrical for my taste. Interesting textures though. 6</td>', 'Too symmetrical for my taste. Interesting textures though. 6', '2003-09-07 19:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(411673, 35661, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice textures, lighting and tones. Composition doesn''t do much for me though. 7</td>', 'Very nice textures, lighting and tones. Composition doesn''t do much for me though. 7', '2003-09-07 19:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(411674, 35420, 8522, '<td valign="top">The light here doesn''t work too well, the shadows really detract from the shot. Not sure about your composition. 4</td>', 'The light here doesn''t work too well, the shadows really detract from the shot. Not sure about your composition. 4', '2003-09-07 19:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(411676, 35509, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea for repetition. Shame that the pressure on the pen adds an unattractive yellow colouring to the model''s hand. I''d have done the shot while holding the pen lightly. 6</td>', 'Great idea for repetition. Shame that the pressure on the pen adds an unattractive yellow colouring to the model''s hand. I''d have done the shot while holding the pen lightly. 6', '2003-09-07 19:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
