(411681, 35468, 8522, '<td valign="top">Bit too much like a snapshot. Shame the sky and background is badly burnt out. 4</td>', 'Bit too much like a snapshot. Shame the sky and background is badly burnt out. 4', '2003-09-07 19:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(411683, 35807, 8522, '<td valign="top">A real shame that the person on the right has his face obscured by the horse in the foreground. 5</td>', 'A real shame that the person on the right has his face obscured by the horse in the foreground. 5', '2003-09-07 19:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(411686, 35211, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea, shame about the lighting which doesn''t flatter the skin tone of the hand. The thumb is exerting too much pressure which is resulting in a yellow tint at the end of the thumb. Bit too much glare on the card to the left of the frame. 6</td>', 'Great idea, shame about the lighting which doesn''t flatter the skin tone of the hand. The thumb is exerting too much pressure which is resulting in a yellow tint at the end of the thumb. Bit too much glare on the card to the left of the frame. 6', '2003-09-07 19:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(411689, 35605, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the lighting is resulting in a lot of glare from the balloons, and unattractive shadows on the subject''s face. 4</td>', 'Nice idea, but the lighting is resulting in a lot of glare from the balloons, and unattractive shadows on the subject''s face. 4', '2003-09-07 20:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(411690, 35463, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really enter into the spirit of the challenge for me. Impressive photo though, if a little in need of sharpening. 4</td>', 'Doesn''t really enter into the spirit of the challenge for me. Impressive photo though, if a little in need of sharpening. 4', '2003-09-07 20:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(411692, 35352, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame it''s so noisy. And it doesn''t look like Adagio to me. The lighting gives a bit of glare in places. 5</td>', 'Shame it''s so noisy. And it doesn''t look like Adagio to me. The lighting gives a bit of glare in places. 5', '2003-09-07 20:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(411693, 35935, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge. I''m not sure I like the headstock precisely splitting the frame in two though. Well lit. I feel that you could have thought about how to compose the shot to mirror the idea of repetition in areas of your frame other than the printed music. I don''t think the repeated tuning pegs mirror the idea of repetition in the music. 7</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge. I''m not sure I like the headstock precisely splitting the frame in two though. Well lit. I feel that you could have thought about how to compose the shot to mirror the idea of repetition in areas of your frame other than the printed music. I don''t think the repeated tuning pegs mirror the idea of repetition in the music. 7', '2003-09-07 20:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(411697, 35813, 8522, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a photo in the archives at DPC... it may even be the same place. <br/>Aha, it''s ''Round'' by albright1, and is of the Jefferson Memorial. That one got a red ribbon because of the great use of light and shade. The crop was very effective. Although yours is an attractive shot, there is nothing here in the way of light or composition to lift this above a 6 for me. Score: 6</td>', 'This reminds me of a photo in the archives at DPC... it may even be the same place. Aha, it''s ''Round'' by albright1, and is of the Jefferson Memorial. That one got a red ribbon because of the great use of light and shade. The crop was very effective. Although yours is an attractive shot, there is nothing here in the way of light or composition to lift this above a 6 for me. Score: 6', '2003-09-07 20:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(411699, 35876, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, and textures. Interesting composition. 7</td>', 'Great lighting, and textures. Interesting composition. 7', '2003-09-07 20:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(411700, 35911, 8522, '<td valign="top">Too symmetrical for my taste. The quality of the light doesn''t seem to do much for the shot. 5</td>', 'Too symmetrical for my taste. The quality of the light doesn''t seem to do much for the shot. 5', '2003-09-07 20:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(411702, 35898, 8522, '<td valign="top">Ah, it took me a little while to work out that the repetition was in his sets of ''reps''. I suspect many people may not have got this. The starkness is an interesting way of building atmosphere for a shot of someone working out. I think you should have increased the contrast loads though. 6</td>', 'Ah, it took me a little while to work out that the repetition was in his sets of ''reps''. I suspect many people may not have got this. The starkness is an interesting way of building atmosphere for a shot of someone working out. I think you should have increased the contrast loads though. 6', '2003-09-07 20:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(411704, 35763, 7778, '<td valign="top">The sheer number of balloons, at varying sizes and colours make a wonderful postcard! The cumuli  with their equally random arrangement add further viewing pleasure. The rich colours, apparently taken through a polarizer, stand out perfectly against the hue of the sky.<br/> <br/>Good (or lucky) composition, technically apt for the purpose, this is a very  l i g h t  capture, but a very successful one. Fun, fun, fun.</td>', 'The sheer number of balloons, at varying sizes and colours make a wonderful postcard! The cumuli  with their equally random arrangement add further viewing pleasure. The rich colours, apparently taken through a polarizer, stand out perfectly against the hue of the sky. Good (or lucky) composition, technically apt for the purpose, this is a very  l i g h t  capture, but a very successful one. Fun, fun, fun.', '2003-09-07 20:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(411705, 35859, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea, reminds me of Jacko''s honey shot. I''d have looked for something extra here (like the drop of honey in the honey picture) to lift this above the ordinary though. 6</td>', 'Great idea, reminds me of Jacko''s honey shot. I''d have looked for something extra here (like the drop of honey in the honey picture) to lift this above the ordinary though. 6', '2003-09-07 20:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
