(411833, 35368, 7969, '<td valign="top">Good subject, would like to see it with you taking a step to the left to have a bit more straight on look, i think would still have sense of perspective too. just a thought.</td>', 'Good subject, would like to see it with you taking a step to the left to have a bit more straight on look, i think would still have sense of perspective too. just a thought.', '2003-09-07 23:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(411836, 35797, 2333, '<td valign="top">talk about an uncommonly good image of a common subject. Well done!<br/>I love the lighitng; your exposure is spot on, and DoF is perfect.<br/>Did you also try this in landscape (with eye of foremost mannequin at upper left "rule of thirds" point &amp; a little neg. space at right)?</td>', 'talk about an uncommonly good image of a common subject. Well done!I love the lighitng; your exposure is spot on, and DoF is perfect.Did you also try this in landscape (with eye of foremost mannequin at upper left "rule of thirds" point & a little neg. space at right)?', '2003-09-07 23:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(411838, 35696, 2333, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful sky. I like the abstract nature of this shot. Was it possible to include the top of the nearest spiral of the antenna?<br/>BTW, just how far up did you have to climb to get this shot??</td>', 'What a beautiful sky. I like the abstract nature of this shot. Was it possible to include the top of the nearest spiral of the antenna?BTW, just how far up did you have to climb to get this shot??', '2003-09-07 23:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(411839, 35487, 2333, '<td valign="top">Very cool inperpretation of the subject. I like the small aperture giving the stars on the LEDs. Wish the bit of light on the nearest cables at lower right was not there.</td>', 'Very cool inperpretation of the subject. I like the small aperture giving the stars on the LEDs. Wish the bit of light on the nearest cables at lower right was not there.', '2003-09-07 23:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(411840, 34997, 8130, '<td valign="top">One of ''my'' three 10''s this week!  Awesome capture.</td>', 'One of ''my'' three 10''s this week!  Awesome capture.', '2003-09-07 23:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(411841, 35611, 8130, '<td valign="top">This is magnificent!  One of ''my'' three tens this week.</td>', 'This is magnificent!  One of ''my'' three tens this week.', '2003-09-07 23:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(411842, 35775, 8130, '<td valign="top">Mesmerizing!  One of ''my'' three tens this week.</td>', 'Mesmerizing!  One of ''my'' three tens this week.', '2003-09-07 23:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(411843, 35919, 2333, '<td valign="top">Super! This is obviously &gt;1:1 magnification... did you crop from  a larger image? While I like your choice of DoF, I''m wondering if bringing the center of focus to the center of the seam would have made this even better?</td>', 'Super! This is obviously >1:1 magnification... did you crop from  a larger image? While I like your choice of DoF, I''m wondering if bringing the center of focus to the center of the seam would have made this even better?', '2003-09-07 23:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(411845, 35661, 10799, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love the angle and the colors and the idea!</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love the angle and the colors and the idea!', '2003-09-07 23:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(411847, 35456, 1041, '<td valign="top">Well, congrats on the upcoming event and also on a superb photo.  One of my favorites this week.  I like how they are all arranged a little differently and not neatly lined up, plus, you truly did fill the frame with all of them.  Hope you get a ribbon as a wedding present :)</td>', 'Well, congrats on the upcoming event and also on a superb photo.  One of my favorites this week.  I like how they are all arranged a little differently and not neatly lined up, plus, you truly did fill the frame with all of them.  Hope you get a ribbon as a wedding present :)', '2003-09-07 23:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(411849, 35935, 1041, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  There are many things I like.  The diagonal.  The pure black and bright white and tonal range.  The repetition of the keys as wall as the notes as well as the strings, and the fact that a couple of the keys are turned.  I wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Beautifully done.  There are many things I like.  The diagonal.  The pure black and bright white and tonal range.  The repetition of the keys as wall as the notes as well as the strings, and the fact that a couple of the keys are turned.  I wouldn''t change a thing.', '2003-09-07 23:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(411850, 34997, 2333, '<td valign="top">Great catch and a good choice of shutter speed! You could have brought up the bottom end of your levels a bit, this would have darkened the sky.</td>', 'Great catch and a good choice of shutter speed! You could have brought up the bottom end of your levels a bit, this would have darkened the sky.', '2003-09-07 23:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(411851, 35927, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great focus and arrangement.  Simplicity.  DOF is spectacular.  I wish the pieces were a tad less shiny for less glare, but that''s being picky.  Your exposure is spot-on. Border works well.</td>', 'Great focus and arrangement.  Simplicity.  DOF is spectacular.  I wish the pieces were a tad less shiny for less glare, but that''s being picky.  Your exposure is spot-on. Border works well.', '2003-09-07 23:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(411852, 35211, 5351, '<td valign="top">fun shot!</td>', 'fun shot!', '2003-09-08 00:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(411853, 35388, 5351, '<td valign="top">concept was good - but I think it is too blurry.   Also, the white areas on the right are distracting - I think they call these hot spots.   I would try this again experimenting with different lighting.  The angle I think is right on.  Just my opinion:)</td>', 'concept was good - but I think it is too blurry.   Also, the white areas on the right are distracting - I think they call these hot spots.   I would try this again experimenting with different lighting.  The angle I think is right on.  Just my opinion:)', '2003-09-08 00:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(411855, 35863, 5351, '<td valign="top">I really like everything about this photo - the composition is incredible!  Also like the tone, focus and border selection.  Nice job - high score:)</td>', 'I really like everything about this photo - the composition is incredible!  Also like the tone, focus and border selection.  Nice job - high score:)', '2003-09-08 00:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(411857, 35883, 7151, '<td valign="top">This leaves me wondering what it would have looked like in color.  There doesn\''t seem to be enought dynamic range for it to work well in b&amp;w.  Beyond that, I like it.  Nice and sharp, good DOF.</td>', 'This leaves me wondering what it would have looked like in color.  There doesn\''t seem to be enought dynamic range for it to work well in b&w.  Beyond that, I like it.  Nice and sharp, good DOF.', '2003-09-08 00:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(411860, 35935, 1031, '<td valign="top">They kind of resemble each other too</td>', 'They kind of resemble each other too', '2003-09-08 00:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(411861, 35776, 5351, '<td valign="top">What a neat thing to get to take a photo of!  Excelent job with the focus and composition.  Good border selection.  Good luck in the challenge:)</td>', 'What a neat thing to get to take a photo of!  Excelent job with the focus and composition.  Good border selection.  Good luck in the challenge:)', '2003-09-08 00:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(411862, 35304, 7151, '<td valign="top">Had to count, just to be sure!  ;-)  Cool shot.</td>', 'Had to count, just to be sure!  ;-)  Cool shot.', '2003-09-08 00:20:17.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(411864, 35618, 11184, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Am wondering how hard it was to get this.  Perfect job.</td>', 'Awesome!  Am wondering how hard it was to get this.  Perfect job.', '2003-09-08 00:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(411865, 35018, 2333, '<td valign="top">i really like your framing on this... I wonder if a polarizer could have deepened the blue in the sky al little? <br/>I''m still trying to figure out how this thing stands up... looks like the tension on the wires is all that gives it rigidity... think I''ve read about such structures, but not seen one. Would like to know where this is, and what''s the function.</td>', 'i really like your framing on this... I wonder if a polarizer could have deepened the blue in the sky al little? I''m still trying to figure out how this thing stands up... looks like the tension on the wires is all that gives it rigidity... think I''ve read about such structures, but not seen one. Would like to know where this is, and what''s the function.', '2003-09-08 00:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(411868, 35178, 1031, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Malvina Reynolds song "Little Boxes."</td>', 'Reminds me of the Malvina Reynolds song "Little Boxes."', '2003-09-08 00:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(411869, 35818, 7151, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what it is, but it sure looks cool lit like that.  The only think I don''t like is the narrow DOF - there''s just not enough of it in focus to draw my eyes.  After looking at it for more than about 5 seconds, I start to feel like my eyes are crossing and I can''t focus!</td>', 'I have no idea what it is, but it sure looks cool lit like that.  The only think I don''t like is the narrow DOF - there''s just not enough of it in focus to draw my eyes.  After looking at it for more than about 5 seconds, I start to feel like my eyes are crossing and I can''t focus!', '2003-09-08 00:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(411870, 35653, 11184, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but could maybe use a little more of that 3rd one.  More like  2 1/4 instead of 3 as it is. Really like the color and texture though.</td>', 'Great shot, but could maybe use a little more of that 3rd one.  More like  2 1/4 instead of 3 as it is. Really like the color and texture though.', '2003-09-08 00:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(411871, 35326, 7151, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  A little softer light might have worked a little better, and it''s a bit noisy - Neat Image might have helped that.</td>', 'Nicely done.  A little softer light might have worked a little better, and it''s a bit noisy - Neat Image might have helped that.', '2003-09-08 00:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(411872, 35665, 7151, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, good subject.  I would have liked it more centered (it shows that your slightly to the right of it''s center), and it would have been better without that guy in the background (I know that''s hard to control, but in this case another shot a few seconds later might have fixed it).</td>', 'Nice and sharp, good subject.  I would have liked it more centered (it shows that your slightly to the right of it''s center), and it would have been better without that guy in the background (I know that''s hard to control, but in this case another shot a few seconds later might have fixed it).', '2003-09-08 00:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(411873, 35696, 11184, '<td valign="top">Crazy sky!  Cool shot!</td>', 'Crazy sky!  Cool shot!', '2003-09-08 00:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(411874, 35784, 7151, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it''ll reach ribbon heaven, but it should get pretty close.  Nice idea, great contrast, lighting and detail.  This is probably a bit nit-picky, but it stands out to me that the angels don''t seem entirely lined up.  Maybe it''s a perspective thing.  Other than that, great shot.</td>', 'Not sure if it''ll reach ribbon heaven, but it should get pretty close.  Nice idea, great contrast, lighting and detail.  This is probably a bit nit-picky, but it stands out to me that the angels don''t seem entirely lined up.  Maybe it''s a perspective thing.  Other than that, great shot.', '2003-09-08 00:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(411875, 35919, 7151, '<td valign="top">Wow, is that really a baseball?  Great macro, very close up.  Reversed lens???  Good lighting too - nice and bright with no reflections.</td>', 'Wow, is that really a baseball?  Great macro, very close up.  Reversed lens???  Good lighting too - nice and bright with no reflections.', '2003-09-08 00:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(411877, 35903, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like the b&amp;w feel without it actually being b&amp;w.  Also like that thee are some crosses that are lighter than others.  The angle you have chosen works well, so does the DOF.  A small suggestion would be to crop a bit off the left to give the illusion of it being more infinitie, as well as maybe a tiny sliver of the of the top to remove that little bit of black above the first cross. Regardless, I think you have one of the really good ones here.</td>', 'I like the b&w feel without it actually being b&w.  Also like that thee are some crosses that are lighter than others.  The angle you have chosen works well, so does the DOF.  A small suggestion would be to crop a bit off the left to give the illusion of it being more infinitie, as well as maybe a tiny sliver of the of the top to remove that little bit of black above the first cross. Regardless, I think you have one of the really good ones here.', '2003-09-08 00:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(411879, 35018, 10643, '<td valign="top"><b>Thank you! :)</b></td>', 'Thank you! :)', '2003-09-08 01:03:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(411880, 35741, 8953, '<td valign="top">Thanks folks for a great challenge...</td>', 'Thanks folks for a great challenge...', '2003-09-08 01:03:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(411882, 35772, 10643, '<td valign="top">I was in Toronto during the Ex and on my way out of the city there were fighter planes zooming back and forth overhead. Nothing like this impressive, though! Great shot :)</td>', 'I was in Toronto during the Ex and on my way out of the city there were fighter planes zooming back and forth overhead. Nothing like this impressive, though! Great shot :)', '2003-09-08 01:05:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(411885, 34989, 200, '<td valign="top">well i thought this shot was just great...sure figured it would score better than this</td>', 'well i thought this shot was just great...sure figured it would score better than this', '2003-09-08 01:09:22.000000', NULL, 0),
