(412052, 35407, 1135, '<td valign="top">Steve, I didn''t vote on the challenge but I think you were robbed. This should have scored higher IMHO. I really like the sharp focus and vivid colors. The sky is very noise free, did you use NeatImage or is it that good coming out of the camera?  Looks repetitious to me, I can envision the apartments going on forever. Nice Job.</td>', 'Steve, I didn''t vote on the challenge but I think you were robbed. This should have scored higher IMHO. I really like the sharp focus and vivid colors. The sky is very noise free, did you use NeatImage or is it that good coming out of the camera?  Looks repetitious to me, I can envision the apartments going on forever. Nice Job.', '2003-09-08 03:02:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(412055, 35018, 10170, '<td valign="top">Astounding, and a very well deserved first place :)</td>', 'Astounding, and a very well deserved first place :)', '2003-09-08 03:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(412067, 35763, 6999, '<td valign="top">Never got round to finishing voting, let alone commenting, but this was my personal favourite of those i saw: still quite surprised it didn''t finish higher, and for the life of me couldn''t see why it didn''t. Excellent work Yanick.</td>', 'Never got round to finishing voting, let alone commenting, but this was my personal favourite of those i saw: still quite surprised it didn''t finish higher, and for the life of me couldn''t see why it didn''t. Excellent work Yanick.', '2003-09-08 03:38:56.000000', NULL, 0),
