(412329, 35784, 11184, '<td valign="top">A ONE and 15 total votes of 4 and below.  Those voters should be ashamed of themselves.  I mean come on!  I invite the ONE and and 14 others 4 and below to defend themselves and explain why this photo is in their eyes below average and worthy in any way of the "BAD" end of the scale.  Or did you think 1 was for 1st place?  <br/>Anyway, while you were a little bit robbed here Hugh, thank you for putting in such an obviously great effort once again that at least some of us can admire and learn from.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-09-08 23:46:59.</i></td>', 'A ONE and 15 total votes of 4 and below.  Those voters should be ashamed of themselves.  I mean come on!  I invite the ONE and and 14 others 4 and below to defend themselves and explain why this photo is in their eyes below average and worthy in any way of the "BAD" end of the scale.  Or did you think 1 was for 1st place?  Anyway, while you were a little bit robbed here Hugh, thank you for putting in such an obviously great effort once again that at least some of us can admire and learn from.', '2003-09-08 11:28:23.000000', '2003-09-09 00:46:59.000000', 0),
