(532672, 35118, 5158, '<td valign="top">Hi Anne;<br/> <br/>This image is amazing for its shape and texture and of course due to the great choise of color. As some other did already point out, the ladder disturbes the natural structure of the wood of the boxes. I think this too. <br/>An old wooden ladder would have been great her: it would not disturb, because it would be of the same material as the boxes, but would bring in a dynamic, living element. Otherwise it would look to artificial.<br/> <br/>Jörg<br/></td>', 'Hi Anne; This image is amazing for its shape and texture and of course due to the great choise of color. As some other did already point out, the ladder disturbes the natural structure of the wood of the boxes. I think this too. An old wooden ladder would have been great her: it would not disturb, because it would be of the same material as the boxes, but would bring in a dynamic, living element. Otherwise it would look to artificial. Jörg', '2004-01-05 16:33:52.000000', NULL, 0),
